# Security rules — secret detection, access control, data safety

SECURITY[5]{id,risk_level,data_type,trigger,effect,response}:
no-aws-keys,critical,key,AKIA[0-9A-Z]{16} in source,forbid,abort
no-private-keys,critical,key,BEGIN RSA PRIVATE KEY in source,forbid,abort
no-hardcoded-passwords,high,credential,password = literal string,forbid,warn
no-pii-logging,high,pii,email or SSN in log output,forbid,redact
token-in-url,medium,token,API token in URL parameter,discourage,warn
